name: Mandate Activation Requested
type: Coordination/Message
description: |
  Intermediate lifecycle Message requesting activation of a mandate in Mandate/Status Authority Confirmed.

  It does not directly modify mandate state. Only the inherited
  applyMandateActivation workflow may transition the mandate to Mandate/Status Active and emit
  Mandate/Mandate Activated.

  The inherited Message correlation fields may be used. No lifecycle timestamp
  is supplied by this Message.
